{"name": "Land of Glarefall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Land of Glarefall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>An action-adventure survival game where every night could be your last.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a royal investigator sent to uncover the truth behind a mysterious energy source known as \"<strong>Black Gold\"</strong>\u2014and the terrifying creatures drawn to it.<br/>Explore a vast, dangerous world where <strong>survival depends on smart resource management, tactical combat, and what you choose to do before night falls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daytime</strong> is your window to explore, gather resources, build, and push the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Night</strong> brings relentless waves of monsters. Prepare your defenses\u2014or be overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a6f31c97193e254de89e39546568d841.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2989cc8db8554ea6bc88e37da2a7e23b.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and Survive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harvest wood, ore, and other materials to craft healing items, upgrade gear, and construct powerful defensive structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hero Growth &amp; Custom Skills</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from unique heroes, each with their own skill tree and progression path.<br/>Tailor your build to suit your preferred combat style\u2014whether that\u2019s frontline aggression or tactical support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruitable Mercenary System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build outposts to hire and upgrade mercenaries who can support you in combat and hold the line during nightfall assaults.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Boss Hunt Encounters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face powerful bosses in special large-scale map events.<br/>Utilize terrain, deploy defenses, and lead mercenaries into battle\u2014or pour all your resources into yourself and take on the boss <strong>one-on-one</strong> in a duel of strength and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.poster.avif?t=1783579259\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.webm?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.mp4?t=1783579259\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "An action-adventure survival game where every night could be your last. Explore a vast, dangerous world where survival depends on smart resource management, tactical combat, and what you choose to do before night falls.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/30f4cde240ae854a89814c447343919ec0f0b7ea/header.jpg?t=1783579259", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Base Building", "Tower Defense", "Survival", "Zombies", "Loot"], "developers": "BLAIKE GAMES", "publishers": "BLAIKE GAMES", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3836120", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 February 2026 - Request Access\n\n14 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/xEWdcchj36c", "first_seen": 1770159600.0, "review_rank": 1276}